    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 3, PIT 1",
        "text": "Justin Brazeau put Pittsburgh ahead on its first shot at 9:04. Zacha tied it 1–1 at 12:07, Mark Kastelic redirected Frederic Brunet's point shot for a 2–1 lead at 15:04, and Elias Lindholm picked off an Erik Karlsson clearing pass and scored at 18:57."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 5, PIT 2",
        "text": "Nick Robertson redirected Kaedan Korczak's shot to make it 3–2 at 7:57. Zacha answered at 14:24 for a 4–2 lead, and Morgan Geekie scored on a breakaway set up by Hampus Lindholm at 16:57, then hit the post about 20 seconds later."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 6, PIT 2",
        "text": "Fraser Minten scored on a stretch pass from Geekie at 8:39. Hagens left early in the period after Samuel Girard cross-checked him in the lower back. All six Boston goals came at even strength, a season high."
      }
    ],
